=== D-CASFCH: GET/PUT/FIELD/INPUT$ on a CAS: channel, MEASURED ===

program (identical on both sides):
    5 MAXFILES=3
    10 ONERRORGOTO900
    79 E=0:OPEN"CAS:D"FOR INPUT AS#3:POKE&HD010,E
    81 E=0:FIELD#3,10 AS C$:POKE&HD011,E
    82 E=0:GET#3,1:POKE&HD012,E
    83 E=0:PUT#3,1:POKE&HD013,E
    84 E=0:A$="":A$=INPUT$(1,#3):POKE&HD014,E
    85 IF LEN(A$)>0 THEN POKE&HD016,ASC(A$)
    86 POKE&HD015,&HA5
    88 END
    900 E=ERR:RESUME NEXT

-- zerobas: AUTOEXEC.BAS from disk + $EA tape, RAM read back --

-- CF-3300: AUTOEXEC.BAS from disk + $EA tape, RAM read back --

  slot     statement                      CF-3300   zerobas
  i.open   OPEN"CAS:D"FOR INPUT AS#3   (CAS_IN_MODE 8)         0         0   SAME
  i.field  FIELD#3,10 AS C$                     5         5   SAME
  i.get    GET#3,1                             58        58   SAME
  i.put    PUT#3,1                             58        58   SAME
  i.inp    A$=INPUT$(1,#3)                      0         0   SAME
  IMARK    -- cas-input done marker &HA5 --       165       165  (ran)   SAME
  i.byte   ASC(A$) after INPUT$ -- 72 = 'H' of HELLO        72        72   SAME

ALL AGREE — the inference is CONFIRMED by measurement
